When a game process exits unsuccessfully after the loading banner has closed, reopen the banner with its exit code and a Dismiss action. Keep that failure visible across remounts until dismissed. Normal exits and user-requested stops leave it closed.

Steam sign-in opens as an Orbit modal while Valve's Steam window is open. Cancel closes that window. After Steam saves the account, Orbit closes Wine and keeps the login. A failure is shown in the dialog.
